{1 = 1-8}
1.	Say to my lord, and repeat to my kid of the mountains, with beautiful horns; to my horse of the mountains, with an eagle's claws; my date-palm, growing on untouched ground and with fresh (?) dates hanging from it: this is what the captain of pledged @varh[t3121.v1]{troops } @vart[t3121.v2,t3121.v1]{@varn{2 mss. have instead:} soldiers }, @wPN{Aba-indasa} -- who, by means of prayers for his king, greatly pleases his king's heart -- your servant, says: 

